export const escapeModelText = value => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, character => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#039;' })[character]);
const number = new Intl.NumberFormat('zh-CN', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
export const modelNumber = value => typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? number.format(value) : '—';
export const modelMoney = value => typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? Math.abs(value) >= 1e8 ? `${number.format(value / 1e8)} 亿元` : Math.abs(value) >= 1e4 ? `${number.format(value / 1e4)} 万元` : `${number.format(value)} 元` : '—';
export function modelSummary(output) {
  const rows = output.rows, sum = key => rows.reduce((sum, row) => sum + (row[key] || 0), 0);
  if (output.kind === 'COST_FORECAST') return [['预测利息支出', modelMoney(sum('predictedInterest'))], ['相对基准变化', modelMoney(sum('deltaInterest'))], ['预测平均占用', modelMoney(sum('averageBalance'))]];
  if (output.kind === 'DEBT_OPTIMIZATION') return [['建议调整金额', modelMoney(sum('refinanceAmount'))], ['年度成本变化', modelMoney(sum('annualCostDelta'))], ['达到目标的企业', `${rows.filter(row => row.achieved).length} / ${rows.length} 家`]];
  return [['重点关注', `${rows.filter(row => row.level === 'RED').length} 家`], ['关注', `${rows.filter(row => row.level === 'AMBER').length} 家`], ['未触发条件', `${rows.filter(row => row.level === 'GREEN').length} 家`]];
}
export function modelResultMarkup(run, { compact = false } = {}) {
  const esc = escapeModelText;
  if (!run) return '<p class="studio-empty">选择版本与企业，运行后查看具体结果。</p>';
  if (run.status !== 'SUCCEEDED') return `<div class="studio-notice ${run.status === 'FAILED' ? 'error' : ''}">${esc(run.error || (run.status === 'RUNNING' ? '计算进行中…' : '本次运行已取消'))}</div>`;
  const output = run.output, cost = output.kind === 'COST_FORECAST', structure = output.kind === 'DEBT_OPTIMIZATION';
  const headers = cost ? ['企业', '基准成本率', '预测成本率', '预测利息', '相对基准变化'] : structure ? ['企业', '当前到期占比', '调整后占比', '调整金额', '目标状态'] : ['企业', '历史评分', '历史分档', '本次监控提示', '触发依据'];
  const rows = output.rows.map(row => {
    const values = cost ? [`${modelNumber(row.baselineRate)}%`, `${modelNumber(row.predictedRate)}%`, modelMoney(row.predictedInterest), modelMoney(row.deltaInterest)] : structure ? [`${modelNumber(row.baselineShortRatio)}%`, `${modelNumber(row.optimizedShortRatio)}%`, modelMoney(row.refinanceAmount), row.achieved ? '已满足' : '约束内部分改善'] : [modelNumber(row.historicalScore), row.historicalTier, ({ GREEN: '未触发', AMBER: '关注', RED: '重点关注' })[row.level], row.reasons.map(reason => `${reason.label}：${modelNumber(reason.value)}${reason.unit}`).join('；') || '未触发所选条件'];
    return `<tr><th>${esc(row.name)}</th>${values.map(value => `<td>${esc(value)}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`;
  }).join('');
  const details = compact ? '' : output.rows.map(row => `<details class="studio-row-details"><summary>${esc(row.name)} · ${cost ? '逐笔预测' : structure ? '逐笔调整建议' : '监控依据'}</summary><p>${esc(row.conclusion)}</p>${cost ? `<table><thead><tr><th>借款</th><th>本金</th><th>当前利率</th><th>预测利率</th><th>预测利息</th></tr></thead><tbody>${row.details.map(detail => `<tr><td>${esc(detail.loanId)}</td><td>${modelMoney(detail.principalYuan)}</td><td>${modelNumber(detail.currentRate)}%</td><td>${modelNumber(detail.forecastRate)}%</td><td>${modelMoney(detail.interestYuan)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>` : structure ? `<table><thead><tr><th>借款</th><th>调整金额</th><th>原到期</th><th>建议到期</th><th>建议利率</th></tr></thead><tbody>${row.decisions.map(detail => `<tr><td>${esc(detail.loanId)}</td><td>${modelMoney(detail.amountYuan)}</td><td>${esc(detail.fromDate)}</td><td>${esc(detail.toDate)}</td><td>${modelNumber(detail.proposedRate)}%</td></tr>`).join('') || '<tr><td colspan="5">当前没有需要或可执行的调整。</td></tr>'}</tbody></table>` : `<ul>${row.reasons.map(reason => `<li>${esc(reason.label)}：${esc(reason.condition)}；当前 ${modelNumber(reason.value)}${esc(reason.unit)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`}</details>`).join('');
  return `<section class="studio-results"><header><h3>${run.goalDefinition?.name?esc(run.goalDefinition.name)+' · ':''}${cost ? '融资成本预测结果' : structure ? '债务结构调整结果' : '债务风险监控结果'}</h3><span>${output.rows.length} 家企业</span></header><p class="studio-result-basis">观察日 ${esc(output.asOf)} · 分析至 ${esc(output.horizonEnd)} · ${run.versionName ? `发布版本 ${esc(run.versionName)}` : '当前工作草稿'}</p><div class="studio-result-metrics">${modelSummary(output).map(([label, value]) => `<article><span>${esc(label)}</span><strong>${esc(value)}</strong></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="studio-table-scroll"><table class="studio-result-table"><thead><tr>${headers.map(header => `<th>${esc(header)}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div><p class="studio-result-note">${cost ? '利率与续作假设下的现金流预测；利息减少也可能来自融资占用下降，不是历史回测准确度。' : structure ? '启发式约束调整建议；未达到目标的企业保留实际约束结果，方案未经真实融资执行。' : '新监控提示与历史评分分别展示，不改写既有风险事实。'}</p>${details}<details class="studio-run-basis"><summary>运行身份与依据</summary><dl><dt>运行编号</dt><dd>${esc(run.id)}</dd><dt>发布或草稿快照指纹</dt><dd>${esc(run.signature)}</dd><dt>本次运行实参</dt><dd><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(run.parameters,null,2))}</pre></dd><dt>运行条件指纹</dt><dd>${esc(run.executionSignature||run.signature)}</dd><dt>数据快照指纹</dt><dd>${esc(run.dataKey)}</dd><dt>形成时间</dt><dd>${esc(run.completedAt)}</dd></dl></details></section>`;
}
